language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario ReplayDiagnostics.
condition ReplayDiagnosticsReady.
condition ReplayDiagnosticsContinue.
condition ReplayDiagnosticsReject.
outcome ReplayDiagnosticsCompleted.
outcome ReplayDiagnosticsRejected.
step ReplayDiagnosticsRead.
step ReplayDiagnosticsSelect.
step ReplayDiagnosticsReplay.
step ReplayDiagnosticsRecord.
step ReplayDiagnosticsFailure.
step ReplayDiagnosticsSuccess.

ReplayDiagnostics illustrates InspectRecordedEvidence.
ReplayDiagnostics exercises RecordedDiagnosticReplay.
ReplayDiagnostics starts-when ReplayDiagnosticsReady.
ReplayDiagnostics starts-at ReplayDiagnosticsRead.
ReplayDiagnosticsReady describes "An explicit recorded range and server-configured isolated replay target are selected.".
ReplayDiagnosticsContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
ReplayDiagnosticsReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
ReplayDiagnosticsCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
ReplayDiagnosticsRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
ReplayDiagnostics preserves NoPhysicalExecution.
ReplayDiagnostics preserves DomainTruthOwned.
ReplayDiagnosticsRead calls ServeMachineLabRequests within MachineLab.
ReplayDiagnosticsRead describes "Correlated, source-session-qualified cursor and scoped admin checks.".
ReplayDiagnosticsRead proceeds-to ReplayDiagnosticsFailure when ReplayDiagnosticsReject.
ReplayDiagnosticsRead proceeds-to ReplayDiagnosticsSelect when ReplayDiagnosticsContinue.
ReplayDiagnosticsSelect calls ManageLabCheckpoint within MachineLab.
ReplayDiagnosticsSelect describes "Resolve range by checkpoint/time/sequence.".
ReplayDiagnosticsSelect proceeds-to ReplayDiagnosticsFailure when ReplayDiagnosticsReject.
ReplayDiagnosticsSelect proceeds-to ReplayDiagnosticsReplay when ReplayDiagnosticsContinue.
ReplayDiagnosticsReplay calls ReplayConfiguredRange within MachineLab.
ReplayDiagnosticsReplay describes "Target layer and fixture/provenance remain explicit.".
ReplayDiagnosticsReplay proceeds-to ReplayDiagnosticsFailure when ReplayDiagnosticsReject.
ReplayDiagnosticsReplay proceeds-to ReplayDiagnosticsRecord when ReplayDiagnosticsContinue.
ReplayDiagnosticsRecord calls AppendLabRecord within MachineLab.
ReplayDiagnosticsRecord describes "Record replay evidence without changing production authority.".
ReplayDiagnosticsRecord proceeds-to ReplayDiagnosticsFailure when ReplayDiagnosticsReject.
ReplayDiagnosticsRecord proceeds-to ReplayDiagnosticsSuccess when ReplayDiagnosticsContinue.
ReplayDiagnosticsFailure finishes ReplayDiagnostics with ReplayDiagnosticsRejected.
ReplayDiagnosticsSuccess finishes ReplayDiagnostics with ReplayDiagnosticsCompleted.
ReplayDiagnosticsRead receives LabRequests through MachineLabChannel.
